P03_KT17 1 {"text": "To renew the Merit Excellence Scholarship each year, recipients must maintain a cumulative GPA of 3.3 or higher and complete at least 24 credits in the academic year. Renewal is reviewed automatically in June, and no application is required.\n\nSource: Merit Excellence Scholarship – Renewal Requirements (Article 000001004)", "links": [{"t": "Merit Excellence Scholarship – Renewal Requirements", "h": "/lightning/r/Knowledge__kav/ka0jV000000nIDXQA2/view", "target": null, "ctx": "Source: Merit Excellence Scholarship – Renewal Requirements (Article 000001004)"}], "imgs": [], "fmt": ["STRONG:*Why wasn't it helpful?"]}
